class.description:
Describes one entry of a [PCKPackage], as returned by [method PCKPackage.get_entries]: a file of the pack, a file that is added to it in memory or by a description, or a removal entry. All properties are read-only. An entry is a snapshot of the package at the time [method PCKPackage.get_entries] was called.
[codeblocks]
[gdscript]
var package := PCKPackageServer.open("user://mods/level_pack.pck")
for entry in package.get_entries():
	if not entry.removal:
		print(entry.path, " ", entry.size, " bytes, MD5 ", entry.md5)
[/gdscript]
[csharp]
PckPackage package = PckPackageServer.Open("user://mods/level_pack.pck");
foreach (PckPackageEntry entry in package.GetEntries())
{
    if (!entry.Removal)
    {
        GD.Print(entry.Path, " ", entry.Size, " bytes, MD5 ", entry.Md5);
    }
}
[/csharp]
[/codeblocks]
